      "message": "[Gerrit AI Review] 🚨 **Critical Security Issue:** The return value of `GenerateGcmIv` is ignored. If `RAND_bytes` fails internally, the code will proceed with an uninitialized (or zeroed) IV. In AES-GCM, using a non-random or fixed IV with the same key is a critical security failure that compromises both confidentiality and authenticity.\n\nPlease check the return value and abort if it fails:\n```cpp\nif (GenerateGcmIv(std::span\u003cuint8_t\u003e(cmd_iv, kAesGcmIvSize)) !\u003d 0) {\n    return std::unexpected(-1);\n}\n```",
